       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFTHRU.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-I PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM INIT-PARA.
           PERFORM CALC-PARA THRU CALC-END.
           PERFORM SHOW-PARA.
           STOP RUN.

       INIT-PARA.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-I.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL.

       CALC-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-TOTAL + WS-I.

       CALC-END.
           COMPUTE WS-I = WS-I + 1.
           IF WS-I < 10 GO TO CALC-PARA.

       SHOW-PARA.
           DISPLAY WS-TOTAL.
